I've refactored the checkout button in `Cart.tsx` with a ref for `handleCheckout` and currency formatting. Now, the checkout button displays the correct currency amount, and I use a reference for proper click behavior. I have also added in the appropriate text, color, and text colors. I'm focusing on an excellent user experience.


